  "prefLabel": "Auc 104.03 Copies of Records",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Auc 104.03 Copies of Records. Requests for access to governmental records pursuant to RSA 91-A:4 shall be made directly to the executive director by sending a request as required by Plc 104.01 with the information specified in Plc 104.02.\n\nSource. #6657, eff 1-1-98; ss by #12155, eff 4-5-17; ss by #14500, eff 2-8-26",
